  "content": "<a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/bisect\"><img width=100% src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702795/bisect.png\"></a>\n\n<center>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-journal-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-213f5c?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-journal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-213f5c?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-journal-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"NeoForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Neo_Forge-213f5c?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=&labelColor=231C25&color=3d215c\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n### <center>Loot Journal 是一款客戶端模組，透過流暢的動畫通知、智慧疊加和完整的視覺自訂功能，強化物品拾取的體驗。即時追蹤你自己和附近玩家的拾取物品，在遊戲中調整每個細節，享受乾淨、沉浸式的使用者介面。</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769699368/header/features.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/u0aVYsI.gif\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>流暢拾取動畫</h1>\n            <p>乾淨的動畫拾取通知從畫面邊緣自然滑入，與遊戲內容完美融合。智慧疊加、合併和定位邏輯確保畫面清晰易讀，特殊效果則可凸顯稀有物品。完整支援物品和經驗值拾取。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>視覺主題</h1>\n            <p>從多種內建的視覺主題中選擇，每個主題都有各自獨特的風格和佈局。每個主題都可單獨調整，還可透過資源包加入全新主題，提供完全的視覺自由。</p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1613/690/lj1-jpg.jpg\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iup6WPg.gif\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>玩家追蹤</h1>\n            <p>即時查看附近玩家拾取了哪些物品。追蹤好友、發現稀有戰利品，或監控周圍活動。完全可設定玩家篩選功能——玩家也能透過隱形效果或雕刻南瓜保持隱藏。在原版伺服器上也能運作！</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>遊戲內設定</h1>\n            <p>一套完整且易於使用的設定系統，讓你微調模組的各個層面。直接在遊戲中調整佈局、位置、動畫、音效和篩選條件，並立即看到效果。</p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1612/362/4-jpg.jpg\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1612/363/5-jpg.jpg\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>精緻的 UX 細節</h1>\n            <p>專為清晰度和舒適度設計。項目更新時會脈動顯示，大量拾取爆發會被整潔地合併，同時追蹤物品總數——包括潛影盒、袋子和其他容器內的物品。所有功能協同運作，讓你的畫面資訊豐富卻不雜亂。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769699408/header/more-from-obscuria.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aquamirae\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/aquamirae.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/obscure-tooltips\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/obscure-tooltips.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pillager-caravans\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/pillager-caravans.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ars-elixirum\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/ars-elixirum.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/accents\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/quXJZzx.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/blank.png\" width=\"45%\" />\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Obscuria\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/patreon.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/discord.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>",
